# sweep: --bare
# A live subject listing pages, cycles its date window, and can be followed.
# A followed subject leads the first screen and survives a restart, and
# Saved can take it away again.
wait-for Preprints
tap Computer Science
wait-idle
tap Artificial Intelligence
wait-for 1 of
expect Follow this subject
expect Any time
clean
shot listing
# The page turn is the listing's own, not a refetch.
tap-id list-next
wait-for 2 of
clean
shot listing-page-2
tap-id list-back
wait-for 1 of
# One button holds the window and says which one is in force.
tap Any time
wait-idle 20000
wait-for This week
tap This week
wait-idle 20000
wait-for Last 30 days
clean
shot listing-month
tap Last 30 days
wait-idle 20000
wait-for Any time
# Older papers shows only on the last page, and fetches the next 25.
expect-missing Older papers
tap-paged Older papers
wait-idle 20000
wait-for 1 of
expect-missing Older papers
clean
shot listing-older
tap Follow this subject
wait-for Stop following
expect-missing Follow this subject
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-idle
# Followed subjects sit above arXiv's headings, one tap from their listing.
expect Artificial Intelligence
expect cs.AI
expect Computer Science
clean
shot followed-on-top
restart
wait-for Preprints
expect cs.AI
tap Artificial Intelligence
wait-for 1 of
expect Stop following
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Saved
wait-for Saved
expect Artificial Intelligence
expect Manage
clean
shot saved
# Manage turns each row into its own removal, and Done puts it back.
tap Manage
wait-for Done
clean
shot saved-manage
tap Artificial Intelligence
wait-for Nothing saved
expect Save a search or follow a subject
expect-missing Done
clean
shot saved-empty
tap Back
wait-idle
expect-missing cs.AI
expect Computer Science
